# config/Brewfile
#
# The applications, exported from Applite.
#
# WHAT IS NOT IN HERE
#
# Nine casks were taken out. Homebrew audits every cask for Apple code
# signing and notarisation, deprecates the ones that fail, and began
# removing them from the official tap on 2026-09-01. These nine failed:
#
#   freetube  imhex  makemkv  metasploit  qbittorrent
#   whisky    xld    zenmap   xact
#
# Leaving them here would mean a run that either prints eight warnings
# or fails outright, with no way to fix it from inside Homebrew.
#
# The apps themselves still exist. Only the Homebrew route closed.
#
#   ./lib/removed-casks.sh
#
# checks the live status of each one and prints where to get it. See
# also docs/manual-installs.md.
#
# The apps stage still reports any deprecation warning it sees, so a
# tenth cask going the same way will show up on its own.

