# cask "xact"
#   DISABLED. Homebrew has removed this cask, so `brew install --cask xact`
#   fails and no flag changes that. Uncommenting this line only puts one
#   guaranteed failure back into every run.
#
#   xAct was a front end for command line audio encoders. Those encoders
#   are still here: ffmpeg comes from Brewfile.extras, and xld is two
#   lines below, though xld is itself deprecated.
#
#   If you find a working source for xAct, install it by hand rather
#   than through this file.
